<title>USA: Intelliquest names Sharples CEO.</title>
<headline>Intelliquest names Sharples CEO.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Intelliquest Information Group, a maker of information marketing services to the technology industry, Tuesday, named its president, Brian Sharplesm to the additional post of chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Sharples, the company's president since 1993, will take on the chief executive position from Intelliquest's founder and current chairman of the board, Dr. Peter Zandan, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Zandan will focus on the company's strategic planning, new joint ventures and corporate alliances.</p>
</text>
